is how much the molecules in said empty space or&nbsp;
boiling seed soup are bouncing into each other.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:31.860
When two molecules collide, they release&nbsp;
a small amount of energy in the form of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:35.700
heat. The more collisions, the more heat is&nbsp;
released and the higher the temperature of&nbsp;&nbsp;

